# Deane Auto Repairs — Git upload also deploys Render

From 24 Aug 2026: when the user says **上传到 GIT / GitHub**, **push to git**, **upload to git**, or similar, **also push to `origin`** so Render auto-deploys. Do not wait for them to say Render separately.

## Do
- Commit if they asked to upload (and there are code changes)
- `git push origin` the current branch (usually `master`)
- Keep secrets off GitHub (see never-commit-secrets)
- Briefly confirm GitHub commit and that Render will follow

## Do not
- Push only and skip Render: this repo’s Render service deploys from GitHub `master`
- Commit `.env`, live `data/*.json`, or keys
- Force-push unless they explicitly ask
